    {
      "id": "claim_1fba12cad40146a5a35c465d64504a22",
      "statement": "The zmeventnotification server launch lines in entrypoint.sh are commented out; the entrypoint configures the event system and secrets but only starts Apache and the ZoneMinder service, so the notification daemon and mlapi do not run out of the box.",
