    {
      "id": "claim_584badb0ec6f4603a40541926199adb4",
      "statement": "The generated mosquitto.conf defines only listener 1883, while docker-compose.override.yml publishes host port 9001; MQTT-over-WebSocket clients therefore cannot connect on 9001 as shipped.",
