    {
      "id": "claim_7cdc2763334c433f922bfca9af8b9c05",
      "statement": "No broker configuration is baked into the Mosquitto image: Dockerfile.mosquitto wraps eclipse-mosquitto:latest with entrypoint_mosquitto.sh as the entrypoint, which regenerates mosquitto.conf and the password file from environment variables on every container start before launching the broker in the foreground.",
