        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c29dd0fb303a4d7ea1ad1dbc907a2dd8",
      "statement": "The compose stack defines no depends_on for eclipse-mosquitto, so the ZoneMinder entrypoint does not wait for the broker; all services attach to the attachable zoneminder_network overlay and resolve hostnames via Docker's embedded DNS.",
